OL,3,AWatch the moment a landslip leaves Skye
OL,4,Adrivers facing a 40-mile diversion
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers on Skye are facing a 40-mile
OL,7,Fdiversion after a landslide led to a
OL,8,Froad closure.
OL,10,FThe ground fell away from the side of
OL,11,Fthe A855 north of Uig onto a local
OL,12,Faccess road on Friday afternoon and an
OL,13,Finspection later confirmed it would
OL,14,Fhave to stay shut over the weekend.
OL,16,FThe A855 road encircles the Trotternish
OL,17,Fpeninsula in the north of the island
OL,18,Fand a diversion route is now in place.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
