OL,3,AWatch the moment a landslip leaves Skye
OL,4,Adrivers facing a 40-mile diversion
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo-one was injured by the landslip -
OL,7,Fwhich was caught on CCTV from a nearby
OL,8,Fhouse - but a group of visiting
OL,9,Fschoolchildren found themselves
OL,10,Ftemporarily separated from their packed
OL,11,Flunches until a local woman volunteered
OL,12,Fto retrieve them by bike.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
